ion and Multimodal Completeness", "short_quote": "Open-AoE also exhibits substantially higher native hand-signal availability than OpenEgo, with 98.93% of evaluated entries containing at least one valid hand signal and 98.02% containing valid signals for both hands.", "evidence_type": "experiment", "extraction": {"source_format": "html", "method": "html-flat", "quality": "high", "visual_validation": "not-required", "visual_validation_pages": []}}, "confidence": "direct", "core_citations": [{"ref_key": "13", "citation": "HaWoR: World-Space Hand Motion Reconstruction from Egocentric Videos (as cited in Sec 2.2/3.4)", "reason": "手部重建核心组件，其世界系手部运动恢复精度决定 Open-AoE 的 MANO 标注质量上限"}, {"ref_key": "3", "citation": "EgoDex: Learning dexterous manipulation from large-scale egocentric video (as cited in Table 1/Sec 5)", "reason": "主要对照数据集之一，也是本 run 相关文献链的节点"}], "notes": "本批次最贴合'数据管线 QC/验收'主题的证据：IK 失败率门是检测质量→重定向可用性的显式挂钩点。三门阈值数值未公开，写作综述时应注意表述为'门径定义'而非'阈值数值'。", "paper_reading": {"paper_note_schema": 1, "card_id": "2607.14183-C02", "review_mode": "scoping", "reading_status": "evidence-ready", "claim_support_audit": "pass", "topic_ids": ["EA-DATA", "EA-XEMBODIMENT", "EA-SENSOR", "EA-MODEL"], "claim_basis": "reported-result", "relation": "回答'可用性'维度：给出大规模低成本 ego 管线在手部信号覆盖上的可达到水平，是评估手部检测链路产出率的定量参照点；同时也界定了重定向输入端的实际可用数据比例。", "verification_rationale": "source_context 逐字支持 98.93%/98.02%；同段后文逐字给出 1,760/97.8%、100% valid boxes、0.947 mean confidence、98.39% in-bounds；图 9(b) 给出 OpenEgo 66.2%/55.6% 对照。卡断言限定在可用率口径，未声称姿态定位精度。", "quantitative": {"metric": "hand-signal availability / window retention / bbox validity", "value_or_direction": "98.93% 单手有效、98.02% 双手有效；1,760 窗/小时=97.8% 上限；bbox 100% 有效、均值置信度 0.947", "comparator": "OpenEgo（单手 66.2%、双手 55.6%，图 9(b)）；理论上限 1,800 窗/小时", "task_or_sample": "约 100 小时评测子集；窗口参数 h=2s/f=2s/stride=2s", "locator": "5.4. Training-Window Retention and Multimodal Completeness"}}}
