utions": []}, {"name": "You Liu", "author_key": "you-liu", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Yibo Wang", "author_key": "yibo-wang", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Yifan Yang", "author_key": "yifan-yang", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Zhaowen Zhou", "author_key": "zhaowen-zhou", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Man Luo", "author_key": "man-luo", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Hao Cheng", "author_key": "hao-cheng", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Bo Zhang", "author_key": "bo-zhang", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Jianshu Li", "author_key": "jianshu-li", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Jiansheng Cai", "author_key": "jiansheng-cai", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Guocai Yao", "author_key": "guocai-yao", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Jize Zhang", "author_key": "jize-zhang", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Chenhao Lin", "author_key": "chenhao-lin", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Renjing Xu", "author_key": "renjing-xu", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Lequan Yu", "author_key": "lequan-yu", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Chao Shen", "author_key": "chao-shen", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Chunhua Shen", "author_key": "chunhua-shen", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Zhe Li", "author_key": "zhe-li", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}], "claim": "Open-AoE 的 110D 密集 MANO 动作表示在当前相机帧系下表达腕部平移与有限差分速度，作者明确声明该速度同时包含手部运动与相机自运动，而非纯惯性系腕部运动——ego 视频的载体自运动会混入以相机帧表示的手部轨迹量，是 ego-centric 路线特有的轨迹污染来源。", "stance": "conditional", "evidence": {"summary": "4.3 节 110D 表示定义段：平移与速度以米/米每秒在当前帧 OpenCV 相机坐标表达；作者附注速度含手运动+相机自运动。Table 2 显示 48D wrist-fingertip 与 62D/20D 接口改用 SLAM 世界帧。", "locator": "4.3. AoE-Training-Ready", "short_quote": "because this frame moves with the wearer, the velocity contains both hand motion and camera ego-motion rather than purely inertial wrist motion.", "evidence_type": "analysis", "extraction": {"source_format": "html", "method": "html-flat", "quality": "high", "visual_validation": "not-required", "visual_validation_pages": []}}, "confidence": "direct", "core_citations": [{"ref_key": "13", "citation": "HaWoR: World-Space Hand Motion Reconstruction from Egocentric Videos (as cited in Sec 2.2/3.4)", "reason": "手部重建核心组件，其世界系手部运动恢复精度决定 Open-AoE 的 MANO 标注质量上限"}, {"ref_key": "3", "citation": "EgoDex: Learning dexterous manipulation from large-scale egocentric video (as cited in Table 1/Sec 5)", "reason": "主要对照数据集之一，也是本 run 相关文献链的节点"}], "notes": "本批次最贴合'数据管线 QC/验收'主题的证据：IK 失败率门是检测质量→重定向可用性的显式挂钩点。三门阈值数值未公开，写作综述时应注意表述为'门径定义'而非'阈值数值'。", "paper_reading": {"paper_note_schema": 1, "card_id": "2607.14183-C03", "review_mode": "scoping", "reading_status": "evidence-ready", "claim_support_audit": "pass", "topic_ids": ["EA-DATA", "EA-XEMBODIMENT", "EA-SENSOR", "EA-MODEL"], "claim_basis": "author-claim", "relation": "回答'误差来源'：腕部轨迹/速度在随佩戴者移动的相机帧下被 ego-motion 污染，使用该表示训练或重定向时误差直接传入末端轨迹；成立条件是选择当前相机帧系表示（其 48D/62D 接口改用 SLAM 世界帧正是对此的规避）。", "verification_rationale": "source_context 逐字给出 ego-motion 混入声明；Table 2 的帧系列（Current-camera frame vs SLAM world frame）佐证不同接口的规避设计。卡断言限于速度量污染，未扩展到位置量。", "quantitative": false}}
